{
  "story_id": "two-elders",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 346416,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The next afternoon Signor Marco came out of his door as Simone was passing.",
      "start_ms": 1645,
      "end_ms": 6108
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "He handed Simone a small folded paper.",
      "start_ms": 6108,
      "end_ms": 8399
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "He said, quietly, \"Simone.",
      "start_ms": 8399,
      "end_ms": 9985
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Please give this to Bruno.\" Simone took the paper.",
      "start_ms": 9985,
      "end_ms": 12980
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "He walked past his aunt's door.",
      "start_ms": 12980,
      "end_ms": 14860
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He knocked on Bruno's.",
      "start_ms": 14860,
      "end_ms": 16210
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Bruno opened.",
      "start_ms": 16210,
      "end_ms": 17033
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Simone gave him the paper.",
      "start_ms": 17033,
      "end_ms": 18618
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Bruno looked at it for a long moment.",
      "start_ms": 18618,
      "end_ms": 20850
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "He took it.",
      "start_ms": 20850,
      "end_ms": 21555
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "He said, \"Thank you.\" He closed the door.",
      "start_ms": 21555,
      "end_ms": 24081
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "This happened again the next day.",
      "start_ms": 24081,
      "end_ms": 26078
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "And the next.",
      "start_ms": 26078,
      "end_ms": 26900
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "And the day after that.",
      "start_ms": 26900,
      "end_ms": 28309
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Simone became a small quiet courier.",
      "start_ms": 28309,
      "end_ms": 30483
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Every day one of them, sometimes both, would come out and hand him a folded paper.",
      "start_ms": 30483,
      "end_ms": 35357
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "He would carry it the five meters between the two doors.",
      "start_ms": 35357,
      "end_ms": 38705
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "He would knock.",
      "start_ms": 38705,
      "end_ms": 39645
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "He would hand it over.",
      "start_ms": 39645,
      "end_ms": 40996
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "He would not say anything.",
      "start_ms": 40996,
      "end_ms": 42582
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "He never read the notes.",
      "start_ms": 42582,
      "end_ms": 44050
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Aunt Rosa never asked him about it.",
      "start_ms": 44050,
      "end_ms": 46164
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "He did not know if she had noticed.",
      "start_ms": 46164,
      "end_ms": 48279
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "He did not think she had, but he was not sure.",
      "start_ms": 48279,
      "end_ms": 51098
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "By the end of the first week, Simone was carrying two or three notes a day.",
      "start_ms": 51098,
      "end_ms": 55562
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "The two old men did not look at each other still.",
      "start_ms": 55562,
      "end_ms": 58498
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "They did not talk.",
      "start_ms": 58498,
      "end_ms": 59614
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "They did not sit closer to each other in the café.",
      "start_ms": 59614,
      "end_ms": 62610
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "From the outside, nothing had changed.",
      "start_ms": 62610,
      "end_ms": 64900
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "But something had changed.",
      "start_ms": 64900,
      "end_ms": 66486
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "He knew this because — and this was strange — because both of them seemed to be sleeping better.",
      "start_ms": 66486,
      "end_ms": 72183
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Signor Bruno had had a habit, on hot summer nights, of coming out onto his front step at three in the morning and sitting in his undershirt because he could not sleep.",
      "start_ms": 72183,
      "end_ms": 82050
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Simone had noticed this many summers before, when he had gotten up for water.",
      "start_ms": 82050,
      "end_ms": 86632
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "This summer he had noticed it in the first week.",
      "start_ms": 86632,
      "end_ms": 89509
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "But after the notes started, Signor Bruno stopped coming out at three in the morning.",
      "start_ms": 89509,
      "end_ms": 94561
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Simone could not confirm this — he was asleep most of the time — but he had gotten up twice at three, on purpose, to look, and the alley had been empty.",
      "start_ms": 94561,
      "end_ms": 103488
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Signor Marco had also seemed less — heavy — in the days after the notes started.",
      "start_ms": 103488,
      "end_ms": 109116
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "He walked a little straighter.",
      "start_ms": 109116,
      "end_ms": 111270
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "He smiled at the neighbors more.",
      "start_ms": 111270,
      "end_ms": 113563
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "He talked more at the café.",
      "start_ms": 113563,
      "end_ms": 115508
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Both of them did.",
      "start_ms": 115508,
      "end_ms": 116759
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Simone noticed.",
      "start_ms": 116759,
      "end_ms": 117870
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "He did not tell his aunt.",
      "start_ms": 117870,
      "end_ms": 119677
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "He did not tell anyone.",
      "start_ms": 119677,
      "end_ms": 121414
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "In the second week, something new happened.",
      "start_ms": 121414,
      "end_ms": 124471
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Simone was passing Signor Bruno's door when Bruno called him over.",
      "start_ms": 124471,
      "end_ms": 129126
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Bruno gave him the usual folded paper.",
      "start_ms": 129126,
      "end_ms": 131836
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Then, as Simone was turning to go, Bruno said, \"Simone.",
      "start_ms": 131836,
      "end_ms": 135727
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Wait.\" Simone stopped.",
      "start_ms": 135727,
      "end_ms": 137325
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Bruno said, \"When you give it to him — this time only — tell him something.",
      "start_ms": 137325,
      "end_ms": 142605
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Say — Bruno says he is sorry.",
      "start_ms": 142605,
      "end_ms": 144690
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "That is all.",
      "start_ms": 144690,
      "end_ms": 145593
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Nothing else.\" Simone stared at Bruno.",
      "start_ms": 145593,
      "end_ms": 148302
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Bruno was looking at his own hands.",
      "start_ms": 148302,
      "end_ms": 150804
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "He would not look at Simone.",
      "start_ms": 150804,
      "end_ms": 152888
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Simone said, \"Yes, Signor Bruno.\" He walked to Marco's door.",
      "start_ms": 152888,
      "end_ms": 157126
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "He knocked.",
      "start_ms": 157126,
      "end_ms": 157960
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Marco opened.",
      "start_ms": 157960,
      "end_ms": 158933
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Simone handed him the paper.",
      "start_ms": 158933,
      "end_ms": 160948
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "He said, quietly, \"Signor Marco.",
      "start_ms": 160948,
      "end_ms": 163241
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Signor Bruno says he is sorry.",
      "start_ms": 163241,
      "end_ms": 165395
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "That is all.\" Marco held the paper in one hand.",
      "start_ms": 165395,
      "end_ms": 168730
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "He looked at Simone.",
      "start_ms": 168730,
      "end_ms": 170189
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "His face did not change much, but Simone saw his shoulders drop.",
      "start_ms": 170189,
      "end_ms": 174705
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "He said, in a voice so quiet Simone almost did not hear it, \"Tell him — tell him — I know.",
      "start_ms": 174705,
      "end_ms": 181027
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Thank you.\" Simone nodded.",
      "start_ms": 181027,
      "end_ms": 182903
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "He walked back past his aunt's door.",
      "start_ms": 182903,
      "end_ms": 185474
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "He knocked on Bruno's.",
      "start_ms": 185474,
      "end_ms": 187072
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Bruno opened.",
      "start_ms": 187072,
      "end_ms": 188045
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Simone said, \"Signor Marco says he knows.",
      "start_ms": 188045,
      "end_ms": 190963
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "And thank you.\" Bruno stood at the door for a long moment.",
      "start_ms": 190963,
      "end_ms": 195062
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "He was breathing carefully.",
      "start_ms": 195062,
      "end_ms": 197008
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Then he said, \"Thank you, Simone.",
      "start_ms": 197008,
      "end_ms": 199370
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Come in for a moment.\"",
      "start_ms": 199370,
      "end_ms": 201038
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Simone had never been inside Signor Bruno's house before.",
      "start_ms": 201038,
      "end_ms": 205067
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "It was dark and cool.",
      "start_ms": 205067,
      "end_ms": 206596
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "There was one main room with old furniture and a small kitchen at the back.",
      "start_ms": 206596,
      "end_ms": 211876
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Bruno had Simone sit on a chair.",
      "start_ms": 211876,
      "end_ms": 214169
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Bruno went to a shelf.",
      "start_ms": 214169,
      "end_ms": 215767
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "He took down a framed photograph.",
      "start_ms": 215767,
      "end_ms": 218130
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "He handed it to Simone.",
      "start_ms": 218130,
      "end_ms": 219797
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "It was old — sepia — and it showed two young men in their thirties, standing together, smiling, arms around each other.",
      "start_ms": 219797,
      "end_ms": 228135
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "\"That is me,\" said Bruno.",
      "start_ms": 228135,
      "end_ms": 229941
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "\"And that is Marco.",
      "start_ms": 229941,
      "end_ms": 231331
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "In 1978.",
      "start_ms": 231331,
      "end_ms": 231956
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Before.\"",
      "start_ms": 231956,
      "end_ms": 232512
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "\"What happened,\" said Simone.",
      "start_ms": 232512,
      "end_ms": 234257
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "He asked before he had thought about whether it was okay to ask.",
      "start_ms": 234257,
      "end_ms": 238038
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Bruno was quiet for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 238038,
      "end_ms": 239958
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Then he said, \"It was very stupid.",
      "start_ms": 239958,
      "end_ms": 241994
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "It was about our father's will.",
      "start_ms": 241994,
      "end_ms": 243856
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Our father died in 1982.",
      "start_ms": 243856,
      "end_ms": 245310
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "He left our parents' house — this house — to me.",
      "start_ms": 245310,
      "end_ms": 248161
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "He left the family olive grove to Marco.",
      "start_ms": 248161,
      "end_ms": 250546
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Marco thought he should have got the house, because he was newly married.",
      "start_ms": 250546,
      "end_ms": 254851
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "I thought I should have got the house, because I was the older son.",
      "start_ms": 254851,
      "end_ms": 258806
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "There was a lot of shouting.",
      "start_ms": 258806,
      "end_ms": 260494
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "I said some terrible things.",
      "start_ms": 260494,
      "end_ms": 262181
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "He said some terrible things too.",
      "start_ms": 262181,
      "end_ms": 264158
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "I said things about his wife that I should not have said.",
      "start_ms": 264158,
      "end_ms": 267533
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "I have never forgotten those things.",
      "start_ms": 267533,
      "end_ms": 269685
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "He has not either.\" Bruno paused.",
      "start_ms": 269685,
      "end_ms": 271663
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "\"That is how forty-three years passes.",
      "start_ms": 271663,
      "end_ms": 273932
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "In the beginning you are angry and every day you get more angry.",
      "start_ms": 273932,
      "end_ms": 277713
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Then you are angry as a habit.",
      "start_ms": 277713,
      "end_ms": 279516
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Then you do not remember why you started.",
      "start_ms": 279516,
      "end_ms": 281960
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "But you have said no for so long that saying yes seems impossible.",
      "start_ms": 281960,
      "end_ms": 285857
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "It is easier to keep saying no.",
      "start_ms": 285857,
      "end_ms": 287719
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "But every day is a small no.",
      "start_ms": 287719,
      "end_ms": 289406
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "And a small no accumulates.\"",
      "start_ms": 289406,
      "end_ms": 291151
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "\"Why did you start writing to him now,\" Simone said.",
      "start_ms": 291151,
      "end_ms": 294234
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Bruno smiled a small tired smile.",
      "start_ms": 294234,
      "end_ms": 296212
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "\"Because I am eighty-one, Simone.",
      "start_ms": 296212,
      "end_ms": 298190
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "And Marco is seventy-eight.",
      "start_ms": 298190,
      "end_ms": 299819
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "One of us is going to die soon.",
      "start_ms": 299819,
      "end_ms": 301680
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "I do not want the last thing between us to be a stupid fight from 1982.",
      "start_ms": 301680,
      "end_ms": 305869
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "I want to at least — at least — say hello to my brother before one of us is gone.",
      "start_ms": 305869,
      "end_ms": 310639
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "So I wrote a small note.",
      "start_ms": 310639,
      "end_ms": 312094
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "I could not have brought it myself.",
      "start_ms": 312094,
      "end_ms": 314188
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "My legs are old, my heart is old, my pride is old.",
      "start_ms": 314188,
      "end_ms": 317155
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "But you were walking by.",
      "start_ms": 317155,
      "end_ms": 318609
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "So I asked you.",
      "start_ms": 318609,
      "end_ms": 319540
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "It is a small — a small — a small — coward's way to do it.",
      "start_ms": 319540,
      "end_ms": 322972
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "But it is the only way I could do it.\"",
      "start_ms": 322972,
      "end_ms": 325299
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "\"It is not coward's,\" said Simone.",
      "start_ms": 325299,
      "end_ms": 327335
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "\"It is — it is starting.",
      "start_ms": 327335,
      "end_ms": 328789
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "That is the important thing.\" Bruno looked at him.",
      "start_ms": 328789,
      "end_ms": 331756
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "He said, in a slightly surprised voice, \"You are a very serious eleven-year-old, Simone.\" Simone shrugged.",
      "start_ms": 331756,
      "end_ms": 337981
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "He did not know what to say.",
      "start_ms": 337981,
      "end_ms": 339668
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Bruno said, \"Come.",
      "start_ms": 339668,
      "end_ms": 340773
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "It is time for you to go home.",
      "start_ms": 340773,
      "end_ms": 342577
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Your aunt will worry.",
      "start_ms": 342577,
      "end_ms": 343856
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Do not tell her yet.",
      "start_ms": 343856,
      "end_ms": 345078
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Not yet.",
      "start_ms": 345078,
      "end_ms": 345602
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Later, maybe.\"",
      "start_ms": 345602,
      "end_ms": 346416
    }
  ]
}